cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  VITEC — Knowledge-Constrained Normalisation and Selective Neural Correction
  for Indonesian Text-in-Image Errors
message: If you use this software or dataset, please cite the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Marier
    given-names: Syauqie M.
repository-code: https://github.com/gitsyauqie/vitec
abstract: >-
  A modular offline pipeline for correcting Indonesian text appearing in images:
  region-level OCR, deterministic knowledge-based orthographic normalisation, and
  confidence-gated neural correction. Includes the ITIEC dataset (653 real images /
  804 annotated sentences plus a synthetic corpus), a layered evaluation protocol
  with bootstrap confidence intervals and paired significance testing, and the
  per-sentence predictions behind every reported number.
keywords:
  - grammatical error correction
  - optical character recognition
  - Indonesian
  - algospeak
  - text normalisation
  - low-resource NLP
  - knowledge-based systems
license: MIT
license-url: https://github.com/gitsyauqie/vitec/blob/main/LICENSE
